---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---

<Layout title="About Max (Koundinya Gajulapalli)">
  <div class="space-y-10 font-mono">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="border-b border-[#162334] pb-6 space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs text-emerald-400">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
        <span>BACKGROUND & IDENTITY</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">
        About Koundinya Gajulapalli <span class="text-emerald-400">— Max</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        Student, researcher, programmer, mathematician, musician, athlete, and explorer.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Core Profile Card -->
    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-lg bg-[#070c14] border border-[#162334] space-y-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-[#141e2e] gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded bg-[#0d131e] border border-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 text-xl font-bold">
            MAX
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Koundinya Gajulapalli</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Online alias: <span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">Max</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Arch Linux // Hyprland // Bengaluru, India</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-[#0d1624] text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30">
            CBSE Secondary School Student
          </span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-[#0d1624] text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-500/30">
            Independent Physics Researcher
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Summary Matrix -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-xs">
        <div class="p-3 rounded bg-[#03060a] border border-[#141e2e]">
          <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 block uppercase font-bold">RESEARCH AREA</span>
          <span class="text-white font-semibold">Theoretical Cosmology & 5D Bulk</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded bg-[#03060a] border border-[#141e2e]">
          <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 block uppercase font-bold">SYSTEMS DRIVER</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">Arch Linux (btw)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded bg-[#03060a] border border-[#141e2e]">
          <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 block uppercase font-bold">INSTRUMENTS</span>
          <span class="text-amber-400 font-semibold">Sarod & Piano</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded bg-[#03060a] border border-[#141e2e]">
          <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 block uppercase font-bold">ATHLETICS</span>
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-semibold">Endurance Road Cycling</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Structured Sections -->
    <div class="space-y-8 text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-300">
      <!-- 01: Core Identity -->
      <section class="p-6 rounded-lg bg-[#070c14] border border-[#162334] space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center space-x-2 border-b border-[#141e2e] pb-2">
          <span>01 //</span>
          <span>WHO I AM</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          My name is Max (Koundinya Gajulapalli). I'm a student, scientist, programmer, mathematician, musician, engineer, gamer, and explorer.
          I'm intellectually ambitious, independent, eccentric, playful, analytical, competitive, and calm. I enjoy difficult problems, obscure rabbit holes, building things from scratch, experimenting, understanding how systems work, and pushing myself beyond conventional expectations.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
          I value intellectual freedom, competence, genuine understanding, privacy, loyalty, scientific truth, and respect earned through substance rather than status. I don't enjoy empty motivational language, performative achievement, or superficial networking.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 02: Science & Academic Ambitions -->
      <section class="p-6 rounded-lg bg-[#070c14] border border-[#162334] space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center space-x-2 border-b border-[#141e2e] pb-2">
          <span>02 //</span>
          <span>SCIENCE & ACADEMIC INTERESTS</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Physics is one of the central things in my life. My primary intellectual ambition is to become a fundamental theoretical physicist, particularly in cosmology, quantum gravity, and the fundamental structure of reality.
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 rounded bg-[#03060a] border border-cyan-900/40 space-y-2">
          <div class="font-bold text-white text-xs sm:text-sm">
            Research: "Relational Time and Cyclic Cosmology in a Five-Dimensional Ultrahyperbolic Bulk"
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            Exploring theoretical frameworks involving higher-dimensional spacetime, relational time via Machian dynamics (the Barbour-Bertotti framework), and cyclic cosmology where signature transitions resolve classical big bang curvature singularities.
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
          I self-study advanced material beyond my formal school curriculum, including General Relativity, Quantum Field Theory, Differential Geometry, Tensor Calculus, and Riemannian manifolds.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 03: Programming & Linux Systems -->
      <section class="p-6 rounded-lg bg-[#070c14] border border-[#162334] space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center space-x-2 border-b border-[#141e2e] pb-2">
          <span>03 //</span>
          <span>SYSTEMS PROGRAMMING & ARCH LINUX</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          I program in Rust, C, C++, Python, TypeScript, and shell scripting. I am particularly drawn to systems programming, kernel interfaces, operating systems, compilers, development tooling, and open-source software.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-1">
          <div class="p-4 rounded bg-[#03060a] border border-[#162334] space-y-1.5">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-white block">Omni-Dashboard</span>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
              Engineered a low-overhead Linux system telemetry profiler and process classifier in Rust and C++ that reads procfs directly into zero-overhead ring buffers.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded bg-[#03060a] border border-[#162334] space-y-1.5">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-white block">Arch Linux Environment</span>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
              I use Arch Linux as my daily driver, customized with Hyprland and a Kitty terminal tuned with the Arasaka Crimson palette (#ff1e3c on #080002 void).
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 04: Music & Athletics -->
      <section class="p-6 rounded-lg bg-[#070c14] border border-[#162334] space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center space-x-2 border-b border-[#141e2e] pb-2">
          <span>04 //</span>
          <span>MUSIC & PHYSICAL ENDURANCE</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          I play the Indian classical <strong>Sarod</strong> and the <strong>Piano</strong>. I study the continuous microtonal meend of Indian classical ragas on fretless stainless steel alongside Western classical piano counterpoint (Bach, Chopin, Rachmaninoff), and wrote AlgorithmicMusicApp to explore the 22 Shrutis computationally.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
          In athletics, long-distance cycling is a major part of my life. I undertake solo endurance rides and mountain climbs, and plan to pursue triathlon and Ironman endurance events.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 05: Skills Grid -->
      <section class="space-y-4 pt-2">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">
          SKILLS & AREAS OF STUDY
        </h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          {profile.skills.map((group, idx) => (
            <div key={idx} class="p-5 rounded-lg bg-[#070c14] border border-[#162334] space-y-2.5">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider block">
                {group.category}
              </span>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
                {group.items.map(skill => (
                  <span key={skill} class="text-[11px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-[#0b121e] border border-[#1d2a3e] text-gray-300">
                    {skill}
                  </span>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
